{"id":84092606596698,"name":"[Event 3x] Mount Garvix Beta [1.0]","desc":"🏔️ Mount Garvix\n\nSelamat datang, pendaki!\nTerima kasih buat pendaki Mount Garvix ! Terima kasih atas dokongan kalian .  Seperti biasa ,  enjoy ya saat muncak climbing tanpa stress! 🌄\n\n🛠️ Note:\nKalau ada bug / stuck / error di checkpoint (CP) atau Summit, tolong terus report kepada Admin ya!\nKami sentiasa perbaiki map ini 💪\n\n⚠️ Peringatan:\n\nJangan skip CP! CP wajib untuk unlock Summit akhir. Kalau skip, kamu tak dapat tamatkan pendakian dengan betul.\n\n🔥 Ciri-ciri Menarik:\n\n👥 Support hingga 8 pemain serentak!\n🗻 Gunung selamat & sesuai untuk pemula\n🌅 Pemandangan Summit yang cantik gila\n🎯 Cabaran ringan tapi tetap fun\n\n💬 Suka map ni?\nTolong tekan 👍 LIKE & share dengan kawan-kawan — sokongan anda sangat bermakna untuk update seterusnya!\n","path":"/game/84092606596698-event-3x-mount-garvix-beta-1-0","slug":"84092606596698-event-3x-mount-garvix-beta-1-0","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/793d4681713b275efb32387ff709f766d36b1d4b806f98006239ae0dd95d7032.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bcc2fa8ac3c1a08d81405ec10a144bc4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1369710,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T17:42:13.302Z","creator":{"name":"G4rD3N14EN4K","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Event-3x-Mount-Garvix-Beta-1.0-ArceusXArchive-57511","_id":"68e94575cc090563b04c159e","title":"ArceusXArchive","game":{"_id":"68e94575cc090563b04c159b","gameId":84092606596698,"name":"[Event 3x] Mount Garvix Beta [1.0]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":84092606596698},"features":"Feature\nAuto Checkpoints","tags":[],"script":"script_key=\"yourkey\";\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://protected-roblox-scripts.onrender.com/5839f20349